This design takes O(n) space, since the list stores n-1 elements plus an additional 0. All operations run in O(1) time, except for creating a new `IntQueue` instance from a list, which takes O(n) time. However, as we only need the constructor and static method `from_list` for initializing the data structure, all other operations remain constant-time.

